# Treat ONNX model files as binary — prevents git from attempting text diffs
*.onnx binary

# Also mark other common large binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary

# archify build output: 97% of every file is the same inlined viewer runtime.
# Committed on purpose so a clone gets the interactive pages without installing
# anything, but nobody should ever read one in a diff.
#
#   -text              no EOL conversion, so a re-render is not a whole-file change
#   -diff               `git diff` says "Binary files differ" instead of thousands of lines
#   linguist-generated  GitHub collapses it in pull requests and skips it in language stats
#
# The reviewable source is docs/diagrams/*.json.
docs/diagrams/*.html -text -diff linguist-generated=true
